        "height": 380,
        "content": "## AI Sales Rep That Never Sleeps\n**Setup:**\n1. Connect credentials: OpenAI, Pinecone, Gmail, Google Sheets, Telegram.\n2. Sheet 'Leads' columns: createdAt, name, email, phone, source, score, status, summary.\n3. Replace every PASTE_YOUR_... value (Sheet URL, Vapi key/assistant/phone IDs, Telegram chat ID).\n4. Upload your business FAQs to Pinecone and pick the index in the RAG node.\n5. POST leads to the webhook: {name, email, phone, message, source}.\n6. Optional: add a reply check before each follow-up so replied leads are skipped. Swap Gmail for the WhatsApp node if preferred."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
